{"namespace":"uhm","outcome":"answer","exit_code":0,"executed":false,"message":"Extracts the gzip-compressed tar archive `archive.tar.gz` into the current directory, preserving the archive’s directory structure.\n\n- `-x`: extract\n- `-z`: decompress with gzip\n- `-f archive.tar.gz`: use that archive file\n\nUse `tar -tzf archive.tar.gz` first to list its contents without extracting."}
